@MusicRecords_HostAddress = http://localhost:5102

### Hent plader (offentlig)
GET {{MusicRecords_HostAddress}}/api/musicrecords
Accept: application/json

### Hent plade med ID 1 (offentlig)
GET {{MusicRecords_HostAddress}}/api/musicrecords/1
Accept: application/json

### Log ind - kopiér token fra svaret til @token nedenfor
POST {{MusicRecords_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "DR-Local-Demo-2026!"
}

### Udfyld med JWT fra login-svaret (uden ordet Bearer)
@token = PASTE_JWT_HERE

### 200: Gyldig rettelse med token
PUT {{MusicRecords_HostAddress}}/api/musicrecords/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Abbey Road (Remastered)",
  "artist": "The Beatles",
  "duration": 2900,
  "publicationYear": 1969
}

### 401: Intet token
PUT {{MusicRecords_HostAddress}}/api/musicrecords/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Abbey Road",
  "artist": "The Beatles",
  "duration": 2847,
  "publicationYear": 1969
}

### 400: Ugyldig varighed (kræver token)
PUT {{MusicRecords_HostAddress}}/api/musicrecords/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Abbey Road",
  "artist": "The Beatles",
  "duration": -3,
  "publicationYear": 1969
}

### 404: Ukendt Id (kræver token)
PUT {{MusicRecords_HostAddress}}/api/musicrecords/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "title": "Abbey Road",
  "artist": "The Beatles",
  "duration": 2847,
  "publicationYear": 1969
}
